# Production build config (committed — contains NO secrets).
#
# The API and WebSocket are proxied SAME-ORIGIN through Vercel (see vercel.json
# rewrites), so the app calls /api on its own origin and the auth cookie stays
# first-party. This is what makes login/sign-up work on mobile Safari (which
# blocks third-party cookies).
#
# Therefore VITE_API_URL is intentionally EMPTY. Do NOT point it at the backend
# URL, and if you previously added VITE_API_URL in the Vercel dashboard, delete
# it there too (dashboard env vars override this file).
VITE_API_URL=""
